###
# ModelaFlow API — exemplos locais (sem credenciais reais)

@base = http://localhost:5074
@tenantId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Criar organização
POST {{base}}/api/v1/organizations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Atelier Exemplo"
}

### Criar usuária (substitua tenantId)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "modelista@exemplo.local",
  "displayName": "Modelista",
  "role": "Owner"
}

### Criar cliente
POST {{base}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cliente Demo"
}

### Criar MeasurementSet (versão nova)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/customers/{{customerId}}/measurement-sets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waistCm": 70,
  "hipCm": 95,
  "lengthCm": 60
}

### Listar versões de medidas
GET {{base}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/customers/{{customerId}}/measurement-sets
